# L §2.2 (writer 8): real is gone from the built-ins (a deflator is written in the ask, L §5.18); a call takes a
# built-in's name or a band's id (L §2.3 Calls), so real(...) names no band: LOAD-NAME.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2020-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input cpi[y in years]: num
input wage: money PLN
input base_year: key years
input this_year: key years

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  cpi[2020] = 100
  cpi[2026] = 125
  wage = 5 000.00 PLN
  base_year = 2020
  this_year = 2026

def wage_2020: money PLN = real(wage, this_year, base_year, cpi)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-NAME ...
